<title>POLAND: SLASKI MARCH NET FALLS TO PLN 10.7 MLN.</title>
<headline>SLASKI MARCH NET FALLS TO PLN 10.7 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results March</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> MARCH						 1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net profit					 10.68 vs   29.64</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   20.04 vs   45.39</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 70.50 vs   80.22</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues     126.37 vs  114.68</p>
<p> JANUARY-MARCH				     1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net profit					 47.48 vs  103.33</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   84.53 vs  145.63</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		224.61 vs  221.44</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues     359.50 vs  342.02</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Bank Slaski SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
